   "source": [
    "# 03 - Output Parsers: 输出解析器\\n",
    "\\n",
    "## 学习目标\\n",
    "- 掌握 LangChain 五大输出解析器的使用场景和API\\n",
    "- 理解 OutputFixingParser 的自动修复机制\\n",
    "- 学会组合 parser 构建结构化输出管线\\n",
    "\\n",
    "输出解析器是 LLM 文本输出到结构化数据的桥梁。LCEL 中最经典的用法：\\n",
    "```\\n",
    "chain = prompt | model | parser\\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# === 环境准备 ===\\n",
    "import json\\n",
    "import re\\n",
    "from typing import List, Optional\\n",
    "from enum import Enum\\n",
    "from pydantic import BaseModel, Field, validator\\n",
    "\\n",
    "# LangChain 核心导入\\n",
    "from langchain_core.output_parsers import (\\n",
    "    StrOutputParser,\\n",
    "    JsonOutputParser,\\n",
    "    PydanticOutputParser,\\n",
    "    CommaSeparatedListOutputParser,\\n",
    "    EnumOutputParser,\\n",
    "    OutputFixingParser,\\n",
    ")\\n",
    "from langchain_core.prompts import ChatPromptTemplate, PromptTemplate\\n",
    "from langchain_core.language_models import BaseChatModel\\n",
    "from langchain_core.messages import AIMessage, BaseMessage\\n",
    "from langchain_core.outputs import ChatResult, ChatGeneration\\n",
    "\\n",
    "print(\\\"Output Parser modules loaded successfully.\\\")\\n",
    "\\n",
    "# === Mock Chat Model (用于演示，无需真实API) ===\\n",
    "class MockChatModel(BaseChatModel):\\n",
    "    \\\"\\\"\\\"模拟ChatModel，返回预设响应用于演示parser行为\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n",
    "    response: str = \\\"\\\"\\n",
    "    \\n",
    "    def _generate(self, messages, stop=None, run_manager=None, **kwargs):\\n",
    "        return ChatResult(generations=[ChatGeneration(message=AIMessage(content=self.response))])\\n",
    "    \\n",
    "    @property\\n",
    "    def _llm_type(self):\\n",
    "        return \\\"mock-chat-model\\\"\\n",
    "    \\n",
    "    @property\\n",
    "    def _identifying_params(self):\\n",
    "        return {\\\"model\\\": \\\"mock\\\"}\\n",
    "\\n",
    "model = MockChatModel()\\n",
    "print(\\\"MockChatModel ready.\\\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\\n",
    "## 1. StrOutputParser - 字符串输出解析器\\n",
    "\\n",
    "**最简单、最常用的解析器。** 直接将 LLM 输出的 `AIMessage` 提取为纯字符串。\\n",
    "\\n",
    "- 内部调用 `message.content`\\n",
    "- 如果输出是 `AIMessage`/`BaseMessage`，提取 `.content`\\n",
    "- 如果已经是字符串，直接返回\\n",
    "- 适用场景：聊天机器人、文本生成、翻译等"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# === StrOutputParser 示例 ===\\n",
    "str_parser = StrOutputParser()\\n",
    "\\n",
    "# 测试1: AIMessage → string\\n",
    "model.response = \\\"Hello, world! 这是一段LLM生成的文本。\\\"\\n",
    "result = str_parser.invoke(model.invoke(\\\"ignore\\\"))\\n",
    "print(f\\\"测试1 - AIMessage解析:\\\\n  输入类型: AIMessage\\\\n  输出类型: {type(result).__name__}\\\\n  输出内容: {result}\\\\n\\\")\\n",
    "\\n",
    "# 测试2: 已经字符串的情况\\n",
    "result2 = str_parser.invoke(\\\"already a string\\\")\\n",
    "print(f\\\"测试2 - 字符串透传:\\\\n  输出: {result2}\\\\n\\\")\\n",
    "\\n",
    "# 测试3: LCEL 管线用法\\n",
    "prompt = ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages([\\n",
    "    (\\\"system\\\", \\\"You are a helpful assistant.\\\"),\\n",
    "    (\\\"human\\\", \\\"Say hello in 3 languages.\\\")\\n",
    "])\\n",
    "model.response = \\\"English: Hello | Chinese: 你好 | Japanese: こんにちは\\\"\\n",
    "chain = prompt | model | str_parser\\n",
    "result3 = chain.invoke({})\\n",
    "print(f\\\"测试3 - LCEL管线:\\\\n  {result3}\\\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\\n",
    "## 2. JsonOutputParser - JSON输出解析器\\n",
    "\\n",
    "**解析JSON格式输出。** 核心能力：\\n",
    "- 自动处理 markdown 代码块（```json ... ```）\\n",
    "- 自动修剪前后的非JSON文本\\n",
    "- 返回 Python dict/list 对象\\n",
    "\\n",
    "关键：需要在 prompt 中明确要求 LLM 输出 JSON 格式。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# === JsonOutputParser 示例 ===\\n",
    "json_parser = JsonOutputParser()\\n",
    "\\n",
    "# 测试1: 纯JSON字符串\\n",
    "pure_json = '{\\\"name\\\": \\\"张三\\\", \\\"age\\\": 28, \\\"skills\\\": [\\\"Python\\\", \\\"ML\\\"]}'\\n",
    "result = json_parser.invoke(pure_json)\\n",
    "print(f\\\"测试1 - 纯JSON:\\\\n  类型: {type(result).__name__}\\\\n  内容: {result}\\\\n\\\")\\n",
    "\\n",
    "# 测试2: Markdown代码块包裹的JSON (LLM常见输出格式)\\n",
    "md_json = '''\\\\nHere is the user info:\\\\n```json\\\\n{\\\"name\\\": \\\"李四\\\", \\\"age\\\": 35, \\\"department\\\": \\\"Engineering\\\"}\\\\n```\\\\n'''\\n",
    "result2 = json_parser.invoke(md_json)\\n",
    "print(f\\\"测试2 - Markdown代码块JSON:\\\\n  内容: {result2}\\\\n\\\")\\n",
    "\\n",
    "# 测试3: JSON前后有多余文本\\n",
    "dirty_json = \\\"The user profile is: {\\\\\\\"username\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"alice\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"role\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"admin\\\\\\\"} Hope this helps!\\\"\\n",
    "result3 = json_parser.invoke(dirty_json)\\n",
    "print(f\\\"测试3 - 带噪音的JSON:\\\\n  内容: {result3}\\\\n\\\")\\n",
    "\\n",
    "# 测试4: 数组JSON\\n",
    "array_json = '[{\\\"id\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Task A\\\"}, {\\\"id\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Task B\\\"}]'\\n",
    "result4 = json_parser.invoke(array_json)\\n",
    "print(f\\\"测试4 - JSON数组:\\\\n  内容: {result4}\\\\n  长度: {len(result4)}\\\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 2.1 JsonOutputParser 结合 PromptTemplate\\n",
    "\\n",
    "使用 `parser.get_format_instructions()` 自动生成格式说明注入到 prompt。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# === JsonOutputParser + Prompt 完整管线 ===\\n",
    "json_parser = JsonOutputParser()\\n",
    "\\n",
    "# 构建带格式说明的 prompt\\n",
    "prompt = PromptTemplate(\\n",
    "    template=\\\"\\\"\\\"Extract the person's information from the text below.\\\\n\\\\n{format_instructions}\\\\n\\\\nText: {text}\\\\n\\\"\\\"\\\",\\n",
    "    input_variables=[\\\"text\\\"],\\n",
    "    partial_variables={\\\"format_instructions\\\": json_parser.get_format_instructions()}\\n",
    ")\\n",
    "\\n",
    "# 查看自动生成的格式说明\\n",
    "print(\\\"=== get_format_instructions() 输出 ===\\\")\\n",
    "print(json_parser.get_format_instructions())\\n",
    "print(\\\"=\\\" * 50)\\n",
    "\\n",
    "# 模拟LLM返回JSON\\n",
    "model.response = '{\\\"name\\\": \\\"王五\\\", \\\"age\\\": 42, \\\"occupation\\\": \\\"软件工程师\\\", \\\"location\\\": \\\"北京\\\"}'\\n",
    "\\n",
    "chain = prompt | model | json_parser\\n",
    "result = chain.invoke({\\\"text\\\": \\\"王五，42岁，在北京做软件工程师。\\\"})\\n",
    "print(f\\\"\\\\n解析结果: {result}\\\\n\\\")\\n",
    "print(f\\\"姓名: {result['name']}\\\")\\n",
    "print(f\\\"年龄: {result['age']}\\\")\\n",
    "print(f\\\"职业: {result['occupation']}\\\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\\n",
    "## 3. PydanticOutputParser - Pydantic结构化输出\\n",
    "\\n",
    "**最强大的输出解析器。** 使用 Pydantic BaseModel 定义输出schema，自动：\\n",
    "- 生成格式说明注入 prompt\\n",
    "- 验证输出字段类型\\n",
    "- 字段级验证（@validator）\\n",
    "- 可选/必填字段控制\\n",
    "\\n",
    "适用场景：结构化数据提取、表单填写、实体提取等。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# === 定义 Pydantic 输出模型 ===\\n",
    "class Person(BaseModel):\\n",
    "    \\\"\\\"\\\"人物信息结构\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n",
    "    name: str = Field(description=\\\"人物的全名\\\")\\n",
    "    age: int = Field(description=\\\"年龄，必须是正整数\\\", ge=0, le=150)\\n",
    "    occupation: str = Field(description=\\\"职业\\\")\\n",
    "    email: Optional[str] = Field(default=None, description=\\\"电子邮箱，如果有的话\\\")\\n",
    "    skills: List[str] = Field(default_factory=list, description=\\\"技能列表\\\")\\n",
    "    \\n",
    "    @validator('email')\\n",
    "    def validate_email(cls, v):\\n",
    "        if v is not None and '@' not in v:\\n",
    "            raise ValueError(f'无效的邮箱地址: {v}')\\n",
    "        return v\\n",
    "\\n",
    "# 创建解析器\\n",
    "pydantic_parser = PydanticOutputParser(pydantic_object=Person)\\n",
    "\\n",
    "# 查看自动生成的格式说明\\n",
    "print(\\\"=== PydanticOutputParser 格式说明 ===\\\")\\n",
    "print(pydantic_parser.get_format_instructions())\\n",
    "print(\\\"=\\\" * 55)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
